            0.885,
            0.232
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We need to locate the point A that is of distance 5 cm from the points B and C. You might have realised that this can be done using a ruler. However, this leads to a lot of trial and error. This construction can be further simplified. How?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.235,
            0.887,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If you have guessed that this can be done by the use of compass, you are right! Go ahead and explore how the point A can be located without trial and error."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.304,
            0.885,
            0.37
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There is a similarity between the problem of finding point A in this problem and point B at step 3 of the second solved example of the previous section (see page 209)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.389,
            0.289,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Step 2"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.315,
