            0.884,
            0.748
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Draw a curve that has all its points of 5 cm from the point B; the circle centred at B should be with 5 cm radius."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.755,
            0.884,
            0.799
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Does this help in spotting the point A? Construct and explore in the figure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.805,
            0.885,
            0.872
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The point A can be located by finding the correct point on the circle that is of distance 5 cm from the point C. Again, this can be done using a ruler. But can we use a compass for this?"
            }
          ]
        },
